OL,3,GNEWSAResidents told to boil tap water
OL,4,Adue to bacteria
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of residents have been told to
OL,7,Fboil tap water before consuming it due
OL,8,Fto fears of bacterial contamination.
OL,10,FThe Boil Water Notice was issued on
OL,11,FSunday for about 70 properties in
OL,12,FLee-on-the-Solent, Hampshire.
OL,14,FPortsmouth Water said a routine quality
OL,15,Ftest over the weekend found a "possible
OL,16,Fpresence of bacteria", although it did
OL,17,Fnot specify what type.
OL,19,FThe firm said it was delivering bottled
OL,20,Fwater to everyone affected.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
